  "result": "I fixed the cause in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`. I haven't run the test suite or reproduced the report.\n\n`findIssueById` took an `orgId` but never used it in its query. It looked the issue up by `id` alone, so any issue id resolved for any signed-in user, whatever organization it belonged to. It now filters on the org as well, using the same `orgPredicate` as the other methods in that file. An id from another organization should now return `null`, so the app treats it as not found.\n\nI only read this one repository file. I didn't check the other repositories for the same missing filter, or whether the service and page layers do their own org check.",
